## Interface: 16001
## Title: UlRemedyForever
## Notes: Utility collection for WoW: Forever: auto repair, junk selling and deleting, a bigger vendor window with search and a bag panel, group invite, quest accept and hand-in with Shift held, enhanced trainer with a trainer preview in the spellbook, cursor ring, movable windows, a sort button on the combined bag, a minimap button with a menu for the Ul addons, inventory tracker, time played per character, a copyable chat log, a dark mode for the frame art, reagent professions and auction prices in tooltips with price sharing between users, loot roll tracker, notes on players shown in their tooltip, reminders to yourself at the top of the screen, a fishing key that casts and hooks, auto summon of a favorite pet, flight paths, transports, dungeon entrances and zone level ranges on the map.
## Author: knitresletta
## Version: 1.28.3
## Category: Knitresletta
